cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use JustSearch in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "JustSearch"
abstract: >-
  JustSearch finds what is inside your files, as a desktop search app or as a
  private retrieval backend for AI agents through MCP. It combines keyword,
  dense-vector and learned-sparse retrieval with cross-encoder reranking, and
  answers questions with cited passages, with indexing, retrieval and built-in
  AI inference on the user's machine.
authors:
  - given-names: Elias
    family-names: Justus
  - name: "The JustSearch contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/justsearch-app/justsearch"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - search
  - hybrid retrieval
  - information retrieval
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - Model Context Protocol
  - local-first
